### Get all todos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/todos

### Create a new todo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Learn MongoDB with Mongoose"
}

### Get todo by ID (replace ID after creating)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID

### Update todo (replace ID)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "completed": true
}

### Delete todo (replace ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID

### Delete all todos
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/todos